This submission uses code provided by the supervisor which can be found directly at https://gitlab.com/mbousse/beta-divergence-based-recurrence-plots-for-audio-time-series-analysis.
All the files used from that repository have annotations on top of them citing the author and release date. The files which were developed for this work are:
1. boa_work (generates recurrence plots for the entire Bonn dataset)
2. data_generation_noise (Which generates recurrence plots for the entire Bonn dataset and given noise levels)
3. Experiments which is used for analyzing and visualizing results for both of the experiments (it uses "SCORES1.mat" and "scores_noise.mat" which are also provided on github).
4. sinDemo which is a short demo of methodology for constructing a recurrence plot for sinuisoidal function
5. 